OL,3,GNEWSATwo held after cannabis worth
OL,4,A#350k seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after
OL,7,Fcannabis with a street value of
OL,8,F#350,000 was found during a police
OL,9,Fraid.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police said about 165
OL,12,Fplants were discovered at a property in
OL,13,FWelbourn, near Lincoln, on Friday.
OL,15,FTwo men, aged 27 and 65, were arrested
OL,16,Fon suspicion of cultivating cannabis,
OL,17,Fproducing a Class B controlled drug,
OL,18,Fand abstracting electricity without
OL,19,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
